<h1>Descend into the world of Freespace</h1>

This is a guide written by the current record holder for Descent: FreeSpace - The Great War and Freespace 2 any% speedruns.

It is also a demo for a simple <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/aspire/get-started/aspire-overview">.NET Aspire</a> stack, combining .NET 9.0, Blazor, Redis, REST API, Docker, Bootstrap, and UI design.
